        "channelId": "6afbc706ece6dfde5ff0811b",
        "text": "RELEASE FRIDAY 🇮🇹 — Sfera Ebbasta\n\nPurosangue was supposed to land on 11 December. Instead Sfera Ebbasta moved it up three weeks and it's out today via Universal Music Italia, with the new date painted on the walls of via Friuli in his hometown Cinisello Balsamo. It's his first album since X2VR, opened by \"Lontano\", whose video he shot in front of Leonardo's Last Supper. The 2027 arena tour already has sold-out nights in Rome and Milan.\n\n🎧 Track: Lontano – Sfera Ebbasta\n\nBest track on first listen? Tell us in the comments.\n\n#RADAR808 #ReleaseFriday #SferaEbbasta #Purosangue #RapItaliano #ItalianRap #Trap",
