        "channelId": "6afbc706ece6dfde5ff0811b",
        "text": "RELEASE FRIDAY 🇬🇧 — deed0t\n\nManchester rapper deed0t drops Time To Move Forward today, his lengthiest body of work to date. The run-up came through singles \"Same Face\", \"Been Around\" and \"Change\", after a summer of UK rap anthems straight to streaming. Soundsystem roots too: his dad DJs in Manchester's soundsystem scene.\n\n🎧 Track: Locked In – deed0t\n\nIs deed0t next up? Who's your Manchester pick? Comment below.\n\n#RADAR808 #ReleaseFriday #deed0t #UKRap #ManchesterRap #TimeToMoveForward",
